{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPLASH-Paintball</strong> brings the true paintball experience to PC: featuring licensed gear from renowned manufacturers, realistic ballistics, detailed tournament fields, and open scenario maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose from various game modes</strong> like Speedball, Capture the Flag, or the action-packed Arcade mode \u2013 <strong>play solo against bots or online with friends</strong>. With smooth controls and agile movements, every round feels like you're on a real field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Regular free updates</strong> continually expand the game, inspired by feedback from the community. Be part of it from the start and contribute your ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This and much more awaits you...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Licensed gear and equipment from renowned manufacturers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Real world tournament fields and scenario maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic ball and bunker physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics down to the smallest detail</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SPLASH-Paintball isn\u2019t new to everyone \u2013 a growing player base is already\u00a0active on other platforms.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563360?t=1771495850","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563360/05d29199dc5737dcb89e5117f3caa47dd446fd11/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771495850","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563360/47e54e97d60ceb90bb6a076d77d59cef8419a590/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771495850","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a